SUMMARY:Lee Brice with special guest Payton Smith
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $99 $109 $119 $139\n \nGet ready for an unforgettable night of country music when Lee Brice takes the stage at American Music Theatre! Known for his powerhouse vocals\, heartfelt storytelling\, and chart-topping hits like “Hard to Love\,” “I Don’t Dance\,” “One of Them Girls\,” and “Rumor\,” Brice delivers a show packed with energy\, emotion\, and authenticity. \nA multi-platinum artist\, songwriter\, and CMA award-winner\, Lee Brice brings together the raw honesty of classic country with a modern edge that resonates with fans of all ages. Whether he’s performing tender ballads or high-energy anthems\, his passion and stage presence make every song hit home. \nRising country artist Payton Smith brings a fresh\, heartfelt sound to the stage—blending modern country energy with the storytelling roots that define the genre. Hailing from Louisiana\, Smith has quickly made a name for himself with his smooth vocals\, relatable lyrics\, and a style that bridges classic influences with today’s country sound. \nSince breaking onto the scene\, he’s earned attention from fans and industry alike\, touring with major acts and releasing songs that capture everything from young love to life on the road. With a mix of infectious melodies and genuine emotion\, Smith delivers a live show that feels both intimate and high-energy. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/lee-brice-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://amtshows.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/LB_Concessions-Events-1920x1080_wsg_Payton_Smith.jpg
END:VEVENT
