SUMMARY:Scotty McCreery with guest Shane Profitt
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $59 $79 $99 $109\n \nWith his warm baritone\, easy charm\, and authentic country roots\, Scotty McCreery has become one of today’s most beloved voices in country music. His chart-topping albums\, multi-platinum singles\, and heartfelt storytelling have earned him a devoted following and a standout place on the country music landscape. \nFans will hear favorites like “Five More Minutes\,” “Damn Strait\,” and “This Is It\,” along with the sincerity and energy that define Scotty’s live performances. His blend of tradition\, contemporary style\, and personal\, relatable lyrics creates a concert experience that resonates long after the last note. \nRising country artist Shane Profitt brings his authentic voice and blue-collar storytelling to the stage for an unforgettable night of music. Hailing from Columbia\, Tennessee\, Profitt has quickly earned attention for his honest lyrics\, gritty vocals\, and songs that reflect real-life experiences—from hard work and heartbreak to hometown pride. \nWith standout tracks like “How It Oughta Be\,” “Better Off Fishin’\,” and “Guys Like Me\,” Profitt blends traditional country roots with a modern edge\, delivering performances that feel both fresh and familiar. His relatable style and down-to-earth charm have helped him build a rapidly growing fanbase and land tours alongside some of country music’s biggest names. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/scotty-mccreery-live-in-concert-2026/
LOCATION:American Music Theatre\, 2425 Lincoln Hwy East\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17605\, United States
CATEGORIES:Celebrity Concerts
