SUMMARY:The Dolly Show: Kelly O'Brien - The World's #1 Dolly Parton Tribute
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $29 $39 $49 $59 \nExperience the sparkle\, heart\, and unmistakable sound of country music’s most beloved icon with The Dolly Show: Kelly O’Brien – The World’s #1 Dolly Parton Tribute. \nIf you can’t see Dolly Parton herself\, Kelly O’Brien is the next best thing. Widely regarded as the most authentic and accomplished Dolly tribute artist in the world\, Kelly has been personally endorsed by the Parton family and even selected by Dolly Parton Enterprises as Dolly’s official body double for film. She was also the only UK finalist in the global #SearchForDolly casting search for Dolly’s Broadway musical. \nMore than a tribute\, Kelly delivers a true illusion. With a pitch-perfect Tennessee accent\, soaring soprano vocals\, and the warmth\, wit\, and charm that define Dolly\, she captures not just the look—but the spirit—of the Queen of Country. Audiences leave feeling uplifted\, entertained\, and convinced they’ve experienced something truly special. \nBacked by a live band\, The Dolly Show is a dazzling\, full-scale theatrical concert featuring Dolly’s greatest hits from the 1960s to today\, including “Jolene\,” “9 to 5\,” “Islands in the Stream\,” and “I Will Always Love You.” Expect powerhouse vocals\, laugh-out-loud moments\, rhinestone-studded glamour\, and heartfelt storytelling throughout the evening. \nAn award-winning performer with an international career spanning television\, musical theatre\, and live music\, Kelly O’Brien has captivated audiences around the globe and appeared on major outlets including BBC One\, ITV’s This Morning\, Lorraine\, Channel 5\, and Sky. \nFrom the iconic silhouette to the signature Southern charm\, Kelly O’Brien is Dolly—bringing one of music’s most treasured legends to life in a show that’s as joyful as it is unforgettable. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
URL:https://amtshows.com/show/the-dolly-show-kelly-obrien-the-worlds-1-dolly-parton-tribute/
