SUMMARY:Eaglemania
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $29 $39 $49\nAMT Member Pre-Sale: Wednesday\, January 28 at 10:00 a.m.\nPublic On-Sale: Friday\, January 30 at 10:00 a.m. \nRelive the legendary sound of the Eagles with EagleMania\, the world’s premier Eagles tribute band. Celebrating the iconic music that defined a generation\, EagleMania delivers a masterfully authentic concert experience — from soaring harmonies and precision musicianship to the unmistakable spirit of classic American rock. \nHear all the timeless hits you know and love\, including “Hotel California\,” “Take It Easy\,” “Desperado\,” “Life in the Fast Lane\,” and many more. Every performance is a faithful recreation of the Eagles’ signature sound\, capturing the intricate guitar work\, lush vocal blends\, and laid-back California vibe that made the band legendary. \nWhether you’re a lifelong fan or discovering the music for the first time\, EagleMania offers an unforgettable night of nostalgia\, energy\, and world-class live performance. Sit back\, sing along\, and experience the soundtrack of a generation — live on stage. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
