SUMMARY:Jeremy Camp
DESCRIPTION:Tickets: $39 $59 $69 $79\nAMT Member Pre-Sale: Wednesday\, April 8 at 10:00 a.m.\nPublic On-Sale: Friday\, April 10 at 10:00 a.m. \nSpend an inspiring evening with Jeremy Camp\, one of contemporary Christian music’s most influential and enduring artists. Known for his powerful blend of worship and rock\, Camp has spent more than two decades creating music that connects deeply with audiences through messages of hope\, perseverance\, and faith. \nWith chart-topping songs like “I Still Believe\,” “Walk by Faith\,” and “There Will Be a Day\,” his live performances are both uplifting and deeply personal—bringing together heartfelt storytelling and dynamic musicianship. \nCamp’s impact on Christian music has earned him widespread recognition\, including multiple GMA Dove Awards—with wins for New Artist of the Year and Male Vocalist of the Year—along with numerous additional nominations across his career. He has also received American Music Award nominations for Favorite Contemporary Inspirational Artist and a Grammy Award nomination for Best Pop/Contemporary Gospel Album. \nBacked by a talented band and delivered with authenticity\, this concert offers an evening of meaningful music and connection. Whether you’ve followed his career for years or are discovering his music for the first time\, Jeremy Camp’s live performance is an experience that leaves a lasting impression. \nFor certain concerts\, audience members may prefer to stand or dance\, especially when encouraged by the artist to do so. Guest expectations differ\, so we simply ask all attendees to extend mutual respect toward one another and maintain awareness of those around them. Our staff will only intervene in matters of safety or when behavior is deemed unruly\, combative\, or disruptive to the overall performance.
